# BrightGrid CCIDP admin console — copy to `.env` (gitignored).
#
# Spring servlet context-path is `/ccidp` in this repo's API `.env`.
# The UI must call `/ccidp/api/v1/...` (and `/ccidp/actuator`, `/ccidp/.well-known`).
#
# Relative (recommended with Vite proxy on :5173):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/ccidp
#
# Direct to Spring (cross-origin; API CORS allows http://localhost:5173):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/ccidp
#
# API with no servlet context-path:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
#
# Used only by the Vite proxy rewrite when VITE_API_BASE_URL is empty or relative:
# CCIDP_CONTEXT_PATH=/ccidp
